== Administrative divisions ==
[[File:NTR district.png|alt=NTR District|thumb| Satellite view of NTR district]]
The district is divided into three revenue divisions: [[Nandigama revenue division|Nandigama]], [[Tiruvuru revenue division|Tiruvuru]] and [[Vijayawada revenue division|Vijayawada]], which are further subdivided into a total of twenty [[Tehsil|mandal]]s.<ref name=":0">{{Cite news |last=Boda |first=Tharun |date=2022-04-03 |title=Andhra Pradesh: Govt. notifies NTR, Krishna districts |language=en-IN |work=The Hindu |url=https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/andhra-pradesh/andhra-pradesh-govt-notifies-ntr-krishna-districts/article65287291.ece |access-date=2022-04-05 |issn=0971-751X}}</ref>

